# reply_cues gets filled by alice.gd right before this cue starts
~ question
T. Warren: {{GameManager.alice.last_question_asked}}
while GameManager.alice.reply_cues.size() > 0
	=>< {{GameManager.alice.reply_cues.pop_front()}}
=> END

~ door_nothing
Alice Liddell: Doesn't do anything...
=> END

~ already_asked
Alice Liddell: You already asked that... I don't want to. [#angry]
=> END

~ dont_want_to
Alice Liddell: I don't want to. [#angry]
=> END

~ cant_reach
Alice Liddell: I don't think I can reach that.
=> END

~ look_first
Alice Liddell: I don't understand how you want me to use this... maybe we should look at it first?
=> END

~ cant_use
Alice Liddell: I can't really use this, if I look at it, I might find more info.
=> END

~ already_got
Alice Liddell: I have already gotten what I can get.
=> END

# items, cue name is the item's dialogue_cue + _truthful / _half / _not
# every one needs its => END or it runs on into the next cue

~ box_truthful
Alice Liddell: It's a box, I should open it... [#star]
=> END

~ box_half
Alice Liddell: It's a box, I should open it...
=> END

~ box_not
Alice Liddell: It's a box, I should open it... [#confused]
=> END

~ cabinet2_truthful
Alice Liddell: There is a police badge! [#star]
=> END

~ cabinet2_half
Alice Liddell: There is a police badge!
=> END

~ cabinet2_not
Alice Liddell: There is a police badge! [#confused]
=> END

~ picture_truthful
Alice Liddell: It's an old picture of a young boy. On the back there are the initials T.W. [#star]
=> END

~ picture_half
Alice Liddell: It's an old picture of a young boy.
=> END

~ picture_not
Alice Liddell: It's an old picture. [#confused]
=> END

~ case_file_truthful
Alice Liddell: It has a picture of a boy! It seems to be a kidnapping case file? [#star]
=> END

~ case_file_half
Alice Liddell: It's some information about a boy...
=> END

~ case_file_not
Alice Liddell: It just has difficult words. [#confused]
=> END

~ shoes_truthful
Alice Liddell: Well taken care of shoes, they are old and a bit too big for me. [#star]
=> END

~ shoes_half
Alice Liddell: Old shoes, bigger than my size.
=> END

~ shoes_not
Alice Liddell: Blegh. [#confused]
=> END

~ clothes_truthful
Alice Liddell: They are well taken care of but old boy clothes. [#star]
=> END

~ clothes_half
Alice Liddell: They're old boy clothes.
=> END

~ clothes_not
Alice Liddell: My nanny would never leave such old clothes behind. [#confused]
=> END

~ police_badge_truthful
Alice Liddell: It's a badge of Detective T. Warren... Why is it here? [#star]
=> END

~ police_badge_half
Alice Liddell: It's a detective badge.
=> END

~ police_badge_not
Alice Liddell: ... There is no name on this detective badge. [#confused]
=> END

~ bed_truthful
Alice Liddell: There's a box underneath the bed! [#star]
=> END

~ bed_half
Alice Liddell: There is something under the bed...
=> END

~ bed_not
